[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797212228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3797212228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3797212228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iVNxE","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T20:44:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T20:44:04Z","body":"You can use `EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved()` for this purpose. \n\nWhen it comes to functions commonly used in tool scripts it's better for them to be a minimal as possible and not assume user intentions, because there are scenarios where you **_don't_** want the scene to be considered modified. \n\nI have projects that use tool scripts to temporarily instantiate things in the editor that aren't meant to be saved with the scene, and in the same script handle the cleanup as well. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797212228/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797328251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3797328251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3797328251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iVqF7","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T22:21:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T22:21:11Z","body":"> I have projects that use tool scripts to temporarily instantiate things in the editor that aren't meant to be saved with the scene, and in the same script handle the cleanup as well.\n\nThat's what I'm currently doing as well, but in that process I messed up and other bugs might sneak in too, so it would be good to just get a notification. I'm just surprised that when a node or property in a scene in Godot gets changed, the editor doesn't immediately mark it as unsaved, regardless of where the change comes from.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797328251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797358954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3797358954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3797358954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iVxlq","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T22:53:19Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T22:53:19Z","body":"Unfortunately, that's just the risk with using tool scripts. Users can (un)intentionally crash the whole editor pretty simply as well if they're not careful, but I don't think the solution though is to assume user intentions with low-level functions, as it makes things too rigid for developers and difficult to maintain. \n\nTechnically `add_child()` itself doesn't even create a persistent change, that's only when an owner is set, but I wouldn't even assume intention beyond setting ownership either. \n\nMy suggestion is always to use a VCS like Git, and when you do save changes (at least via unproven tool scripts) to examine the differences being committed. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797358954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798048449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3798048449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3798048449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iYZ7B","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T06:20:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T06:20:13Z","body":"If you want the editor to be aware of scene changes, you should implement actions through the `EditorUndoRedoManager`, providing the ability to undo the action. This may be overkill for one-off tool scripts, but it's advisable if you want to create a long-term tool (especially if it will be used by other people).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3798048449/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800432172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3800432172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3800432172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihf4s","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:14:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:24:42Z","body":"Thanks for the mark_scene_as_unsaved and EditorUndoRedoManager tips, I will look into them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800432172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800481994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3800481994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3800481994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihsDK","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:25:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:25:11Z","body":">It's fully acceptable that a GDScript tool can crash the editor, and I don't agree with that stance.\n\nIt's not a stance and nobody considers it acceptable. PRs do get submitted to try to prevent crashes due to tool scripts with obvious solutions that don't limit what developers can do.\n\nExample: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112401\n\nMy comments were to point out that.\n\n- Methods exist to handle this issue for plugins.\n- `add_child()` isn't the problem.\n- We shouldn't assume developer intents. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800481994/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800491764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115367#issuecomment-3800491764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115367","id":3800491764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihub0","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:27:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:27:08Z","body":"Sorry, I removed that comment now as it was better suited for a different issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800491764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]